  "notes": "{辞任|じにん} is used for formal resignations from official positions.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {辞任|じにん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to resign\n- {辞任|じにん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{表明|ひょうめい}→表明：14052_hyoumei⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to announce one's resignation\n- {辞任|じにん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{求|もと}める→求める：02316_motomeru⟧: to call for (someone's) resignation\n- {辞任|じにん}{届|とどけ}: letter of resignation\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{退職|たいしょく}→退職：04559_taishoku⟧: retirement, leaving a job\n- ⟦{辞職|じしょく}→辞職：06157_jishoku⟧: resignation (similar, often interchangeable)\n- ⟦{引退|いんたい}→引退：01848_intai⟧: retirement (from career/sports)",
